/-- The Gaussian kernel `γ_t(x) = t⁻¹ exp(-π|x|²/t)` (`t > 0`) of
`\label{ext:fourier-convention}`; its properties are `ext_gaussian_integral`,
`ext_gaussian_fourier`, `ext_gaussian_pointwise`, `ext_gaussian_uniform`. -/
def gaussKernel (t : ℝ) (x : ℝ²) : ℝ := t⁻¹ * Real.exp (-π * ‖x‖ ^ 2 / t)

